# Git does not track an empty directory, and this one is deliberately empty: the fixture is a
# records tree whose projects have no gate assessments yet. Without this file the directory
# simply does not exist in a fresh clone, `project_portfolio` refuses the whole tree with
# "has no gate-assessments/ subdirectory", and the suite passes locally while failing in CI —
# which is exactly what happened, undetected, for several commits.
#
# `_load_assessments` globs '*.md', so this file is never read as a record.
